# Keeps the build context small and stops host artifacts from leaking into an
# image. node_modules especially: host-built native modules and symlinks do not
# transfer, so every stage installs its own.

node_modules
**/node_modules

dist
**/dist
dist-test
**/dist-test
*.tsbuildinfo
.turbo
**/.turbo

.git
.github
.husky
.vscode

coverage
**/coverage

# Every env file, under any name — `.env.development` and `.env.production`
# hold real credentials and must never be copied into an image. The negation
# keeps the template, which is committed and holds no secret.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!.env.example

*.vsix
**/out

.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.log

Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
